{"id":"input-df525a476394","steamAppId":"385400","name":"Weapons Genius","imageUrl":"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/385400/library_600x900.jpg","steamUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/385400/","genres":["Action","Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"platforms":["windows"],"controllerSupport":"unknown","playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"localCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"onlineCoop":false,"maximumPlayers":null},"storage":{"windowsMinimumGB":0.5,"windowsMinimumDisplay":"500 MB"},"verificationStatus":"identified","supportsVietnamese":false,"vietnameseSupportStatus":"not_listed","steamTags":["Simulation","Action","Casual","Indie","Gun Customization","FPS","Crafting","Shooter","First-Person","Realistic","Resource Management","Building","Singleplayer","Strategy","Survival","Free to Play","Sandbox","Hidden Object","Trading","3D"],"sourceProfile":{"shortDescription":"You act as a weapon genius and create ever new types of weapon with better specifications.","developers":["JDM4iK","Droid Riot"]},"content":{"status":"success","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T09:08:02.983177+00:00","identityStatus":"verified","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","shortDescription":"You act as a weapon genius and create ever new types of weapon with better specifications.","detailedDescription":"You are a weapon genius. You know everything about the gun mechanisms, ballistics, shooting skills and other.  You must create ever better and improved guns and earn money through accurate shooting. \n  \n Select and buy the necessary details in order to combine the weapon properties and achieve the maximal performance of fire efficiency. \n Create a gun of your dream!"},"vi":{"status":"translated","shortDescription":"Anh hành động như một thiên tài vũ khí và tạo ra những loại vũ khí mới với những đặc điểm cụ thể hơn.","detailedDescription":"Anh đúng là thiên tài vũ khí. Anh biết mọi thứ về cơ chế súng, đạn đạo, kỹ năng bắn súng và n